't make it here it's time  for a stealthy move with rarity rosalina  her spark ethering can turn her  invisible allowing her to approach the  long walk safely  now that we are close to them we can use  her signature technique and neutralize  them momentarily  this will allow mario to approach safely  and focus on the darkness eyes  [Music]  a few more turns have passed only two  darkness eyes remain but new powerful  enemies have spawned and even bowser  cannot withstand their powerful attacks  we have only two heroes left and the  last darkness eyes are far out of a tech  range  but mario can count on his iconic stump  attack and jump from one enemy to the  other before delivering the final blow  this is it the wiggler is defeated and  our heroes can resume their journey i  hope you enjoyed this very special  battle that's all for now  i hope you also enjoyed seeing an old  friend from nintendo in there  this was only a first taste of our new  take on combat it has intuitive gameplay  with huge tactical possibilities  thanks to the multiple combination of  sparks and ingredients available in the  game  anyone can create combos as marvelous as  they are powerful  the release is almost there and we are  hard at work to polish our game and  deliver the best mario plus rabbits  experience on october 20.  we cannot wait for you all to discover  this brand new adventure  and that's not all  we have one more big thing to reveal  this cosmic journey will not stop at  lunch we have so many wild ideas that we  want to explore in the coming year it is  a bit early to announce all of it  but i couldn't resist to give you a  small peak of what is to come  our post-launch plans include three dlcs  and the third one  will even introduce a new special  playable hero for me as a creator and  for many at the studio it's a dream come  true to have him  going in an adventure with our dear  rabbit heroes  [Music]  i hope you will like the biggest  surprise of our season pass  thank you